        "content": "## 🚨 Error workflow: compliance-bot\n\nStarted by n8n when an execution of `compliance-bot-chat` fails. It is linked in the chat workflow under *Settings → Error workflow*. It does not need to be active.\n\n1. **Error Trigger** receives workflow name, last node, error message and execution link.\n2. **Telegram Alert** sends them to the owner's chat.\n\n**Good to know:**\n- Only failed executions count (e.g. gateway 502, database error). Refused questions (too long, daily limit) are normal replies, not errors.\n- Does not replace the Healthchecks.io ping: the alert says *what* failed, the ping says the bot has stopped answering.",
